   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to Directorate for EU Integrations (DEI) in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetets omfattning genom detta projekt  &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka Direktoratet f&#xf6;r europeisk integration (DEI)/ Nationell IPA-koordinator / NIPAC kapacitet f&#xf6;r att effektivt samordna och genomf&#xf6;ra olika arbetsprocesser relaterade till anv&#xe4;ndadet av EU-medel f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende EU-anslutningsinriktade reformen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the work that will be implemented through this project is to strengthen the capacities of the DEI/NIPAC Office to effectively and efficiently coordinate and implement different working processes related to EU funds utilisation following the sector approach in supporting the on-going accession oriented reforms</narrative>
  </description>
